# misc
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.bak

# The Vercel OpenAPI document snapshot in provider-dev/downloaded/ IS
# committed: Vercel serves a single unversioned document that changes
# continuously, so the snapshot (plus the hash pin in
# provider-dev/config/spec_pin.json) is what makes a CI build reproducible
# and every refresh a reviewable diff.

# transient analyze output merged into all_services.csv by `make mappings`
provider-dev/config/.analyze/

# split per-service specs are build artifacts, regenerated from the fetched spec by `make split`
provider-dev/source/*.yaml
